(5219038, 759391, 83313, '<td valign="top">The shot is good, but it''s not grabbing my attention either. Can''t quite nail down why.</td>', 'The shot is good, but it''s not grabbing my attention either. Can''t quite nail down why.', '2009-01-26 00:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219040, 759665, 47294, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! 8</td>', 'Beautiful!!! 8', '2009-01-26 00:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219042, 759521, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great light and perspective. The finer details seem a little coarse somehow. That might be overly picky of me.</td>', 'Great light and perspective. The finer details seem a little coarse somehow. That might be overly picky of me.', '2009-01-26 00:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219045, 759677, 47294, '<td valign="top">Great colours, good luck. 7</td>', 'Great colours, good luck. 7', '2009-01-26 00:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219048, 759433, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of the red with the bright white snow. I''m not sure if the second tree in the background is part of what the title is referencing or not.</td>', 'Nice contrast of the red with the bright white snow. I''m not sure if the second tree in the background is part of what the title is referencing or not.', '2009-01-26 00:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219049, 758514, 89723, '<td valign="top">You stole my title!! Nice shot though.</td>', 'You stole my title!! Nice shot though.', '2009-01-26 00:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219050, 759671, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong with a wideangle and swoopy clouds!</td>', 'Can''t go wrong with a wideangle and swoopy clouds!', '2009-01-26 00:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219052, 759658, 47294, '<td valign="top">Wow, great lighting - I''m looking forward to reading how you did this.  Good luck 8</td>', 'Wow, great lighting - I''m looking forward to reading how you did this.  Good luck 8', '2009-01-26 00:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219056, 759044, 47294, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it seems the road is more the centre of interest than the tree/s.  Nice composition however and I like your use of B&amp;W 6</td>', 'Unfortunately it seems the road is more the centre of interest than the tree/s.  Nice composition however and I like your use of B&W 6', '2009-01-26 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219058, 759698, 47294, '<td valign="top">GREAT!!!! 8</td>', 'GREAT!!!! 8', '2009-01-26 00:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219070, 759540, 95940, '<td valign="top">topaz adjust?? this is a bit too much for me. I love the feel of the picture as a whole, but the tree it self gets lost. This being the Tree challenge, it should pop out more. I gave you a Five.... usually i give bad scores to those pictures that don''t meet a challenge fully, but your photo shop work is nice.</td>', 'topaz adjust?? this is a bit too much for me. I love the feel of the picture as a whole, but the tree it self gets lost. This being the Tree challenge, it should pop out more. I gave you a Five.... usually i give bad scores to those pictures that don''t meet a challenge fully, but your photo shop work is nice.', '2009-01-26 00:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219082, 759771, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just not grabbing me somehow. I''m not sure if it''s the colors, or the business of the image. Nothing seems to stand out or lead my eye, I''m afraid. Hope that makes some sense.</td>', 'Just not grabbing me somehow. I''m not sure if it''s the colors, or the business of the image. Nothing seems to stand out or lead my eye, I''m afraid. Hope that makes some sense.', '2009-01-26 00:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219083, 758962, 95940, '<td valign="top">nice picture. good job incorporating a single tree into it... but you didn''t even keep the whole thing in photo. It is cropped off. doesn''t really meet the challenge for me. the tree isn''t the main subject. 2</td>', 'nice picture. good job incorporating a single tree into it... but you didn''t even keep the whole thing in photo. It is cropped off. doesn''t really meet the challenge for me. the tree isn''t the main subject. 2', '2009-01-26 00:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219084, 759556, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  The lighting doesn''t seem ideal and the warm colors are over powering.</td>', 'Nice subject.  The lighting doesn''t seem ideal and the warm colors are over powering.', '2009-01-26 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219087, 759044, 102024, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see a better balance between black and whites.</td>', 'Would have liked to see a better balance between black and whites.', '2009-01-26 00:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219089, 759766, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hmm... the framing of the subject isn''t working for me.</td>', 'Hmm... the framing of the subject isn''t working for me.', '2009-01-26 00:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219090, 758544, 102024, '<td valign="top">Image seems a bit soft for me.</td>', 'Image seems a bit soft for me.', '2009-01-26 00:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219091, 758327, 102024, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better if it were sharpened.  It''s very white heavy.</td>', 'I think this would look better if it were sharpened.  It''s very white heavy.', '2009-01-26 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219099, 759648, 102024, '<td valign="top">This image balances on a line between snapshot and deep ephemeral qualities.  Needs just... some little push to put it over into the latter.</td>', 'This image balances on a line between snapshot and deep ephemeral qualities.  Needs just... some little push to put it over into the latter.', '2009-01-26 00:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219102, 759250, 102024, '<td valign="top">Sweet and simple.  I like it.</td>', 'Sweet and simple.  I like it.', '2009-01-26 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219104, 759328, 47294, '<td valign="top">Great photo treatment.</td>', 'Great photo treatment.', '2009-01-26 00:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219107, 758654, 95940, '<td valign="top">put that thing in some soil and let it live. Nice picture. i like the bokeh on the sky and the nice warm colors. would have liked to see a tree though.</td>', 'put that thing in some soil and let it live. Nice picture. i like the bokeh on the sky and the nice warm colors. would have liked to see a tree though.', '2009-01-26 00:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219108, 759652, 83313, '<td valign="top">It looks like you may have lost some of the detail on the trunk to adding the punchy contrast. Otherwise, this is good. Could be from a postcard.</td>', 'It looks like you may have lost some of the detail on the trunk to adding the punchy contrast. Otherwise, this is good. Could be from a postcard.', '2009-01-26 00:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219109, 759446, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in the sky.  The horizon is very prominent, but feels strange since it''s not completely horizontal.  Though I think that if it were perfectly horizontal it would be even more prominent... hmm</td>', 'I like the colors in the sky.  The horizon is very prominent, but feels strange since it''s not completely horizontal.  Though I think that if it were perfectly horizontal it would be even more prominent... hmm', '2009-01-26 00:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219114, 759558, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and an attempt to push the whole isolation concept without the tree in a stark white field.  But the composition feels a tad too cluttered.</td>', 'I like the idea and an attempt to push the whole isolation concept without the tree in a stark white field.  But the composition feels a tad too cluttered.', '2009-01-26 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219118, 759603, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hm.  This tree composes itself.  It''s almost like looking at an internal organ and seeing the veins highlighted.  A lovely subject.</td>', 'Hm.  This tree composes itself.  It''s almost like looking at an internal organ and seeing the veins highlighted.  A lovely subject.', '2009-01-26 00:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219119, 759348, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the image just seems too dark.</td>', 'I like the subject but the image just seems too dark.', '2009-01-26 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219122, 759034, 102024, '<td valign="top">The tree is nice and sharp.  I really like the glow from the snow.  I wonder how this would have benefited from a slightly shallower depth of field.  I like it.</td>', 'The tree is nice and sharp.  I really like the glow from the snow.  I wonder how this would have benefited from a slightly shallower depth of field.  I like it.', '2009-01-26 00:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219123, 759570, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  Good balance of whites, blacks and grays.</td>', 'Well composed.  Good balance of whites, blacks and grays.', '2009-01-26 00:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219124, 757839, 102024, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Well composed</td>', 'Great idea!  Well composed', '2009-01-26 00:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219125, 759706, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very nice ''old world'' feel, beautiful photo, good luck 8</td>', 'Very nice ''old world'' feel, beautiful photo, good luck 8', '2009-01-26 00:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219130, 759712, 83313, '<td valign="top">A shot with a lot of potential. I think the present appearance comes off as slightly dull and low contrast, however. I copied this into my editor just to see what some adjustments did, and I think it would have done well as a contrasty b/w, which really brought out those shadows on the wall.</td>', 'A shot with a lot of potential. I think the present appearance comes off as slightly dull and low contrast, however. I copied this into my editor just to see what some adjustments did, and I think it would have done well as a contrasty b/w, which really brought out those shadows on the wall.', '2009-01-26 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219131, 758940, 102024, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem as sharp as it could be.  Interesting choice of color.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem as sharp as it could be.  Interesting choice of color.', '2009-01-26 00:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219133, 759395, 102024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  I would like to have seen more contrast and slightly stronger colors.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  I would like to have seen more contrast and slightly stronger colors.', '2009-01-26 00:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219136, 759729, 102024, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful sky.  Would like to have seen some stronger colors.</td>', 'Very beautiful sky.  Would like to have seen some stronger colors.', '2009-01-26 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219141, 758957, 102024, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject.  But the starkness of the image really flattens the horizon line to the foreground.</td>', 'Very interesting subject.  But the starkness of the image really flattens the horizon line to the foreground.', '2009-01-26 00:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219144, 759628, 102024, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I really like this image.</td>', 'Good composition.  I really like this image.', '2009-01-26 00:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219146, 759405, 102024, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.  The border works well with this image.</td>', 'Good lighting.  The border works well with this image.', '2009-01-26 00:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219150, 757749, 102024, '<td valign="top">That''s a great find!  Beautiful tree</td>', 'That''s a great find!  Beautiful tree', '2009-01-26 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5219151, 759656, 102024, '<td valign="top">Could benefit from being a tad sharper</td>', 'Could benefit from being a tad sharper', '2009-01-26 00:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
