(5221148, 759249, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...  Unusual treatment... I''m not sure about the browns in the foreground... something looks odd about them.</td>', 'Very pretty...  Unusual treatment... I''m not sure about the browns in the foreground... something looks odd about them.', '2009-01-26 21:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5221150, 758653, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and light... I think that including the road is a mistake.  I hope I''m the only one who thinks so.   Good find.</td>', 'Lovely colors and light... I think that including the road is a mistake.  I hope I''m the only one who thinks so.   Good find.', '2009-01-26 21:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
