(5221450, 759368, 86628, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist look.  And an extra point for using my favourite book as the title.</td>', 'I like the minimalist look.  And an extra point for using my favourite book as the title.', '2009-01-27 02:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
