(5221766, 758962, 80458, '<td valign="top">Really great and lovely photo, but I dont think it meets the challenge. The tree is not the main subject of this photo, in fact, it''s pretty much unimportant! I think if you cropped the island out, you''d have a much stronger shot! <br/> <br/>Seriously gorgeous orange tones and the sun looks great and a great DOF. I''d consider cropping out the ripples in the foreground, i think it detracts a little bit.</td>', 'Really great and lovely photo, but I dont think it meets the challenge. The tree is not the main subject of this photo, in fact, it''s pretty much unimportant! I think if you cropped the island out, you''d have a much stronger shot!  Seriously gorgeous orange tones and the sun looks great and a great DOF. I''d consider cropping out the ripples in the foreground, i think it detracts a little bit.', '2009-01-27 09:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5221780, 759703, 56275, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.. looks like a painting.</td>', 'Very pretty.. looks like a painting.', '2009-01-27 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
