(5222929, 757642, 88136, '<td valign="top">what lovely colors. i like the depth in the blue sky</td>', 'what lovely colors. i like the depth in the blue sky', '2009-01-27 23:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5222931, 758708, 88136, '<td valign="top">thats a very cool tree. i love all the funny little branches</td>', 'thats a very cool tree. i love all the funny little branches', '2009-01-27 23:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5222934, 759368, 88136, '<td valign="top">cool idea with the title. the color changes on the hill are beautiful. a bit much sky, but its not too bad</td>', 'cool idea with the title. the color changes on the hill are beautiful. a bit much sky, but its not too bad', '2009-01-27 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223175, 759368, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great composition! Love the title.</td>', 'Great composition! Love the title.', '2009-01-28 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223176, 759344, 73056, '<td valign="top">Lovely B/W.</td>', 'Lovely B/W.', '2009-01-28 00:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223178, 759174, 73056, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Looks like a winner to me!</td>', 'Awesome shot. Looks like a winner to me!', '2009-01-28 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223179, 759254, 73056, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Nice find, great composition and processing.</td>', 'I love this shot. Nice find, great composition and processing.', '2009-01-28 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223180, 758327, 73056, '<td valign="top">What a perfect shot! Lucky you to find them under the tree like this. Perfect in b/w.</td>', 'What a perfect shot! Lucky you to find them under the tree like this. Perfect in b/w.', '2009-01-28 00:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223181, 759402, 73056, '<td valign="top">Really lovely! The person really adds to it and your comp is great.</td>', 'Really lovely! The person really adds to it and your comp is great.', '2009-01-28 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223517, 759766, 24486, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a little too much blown out. I don''t know if this is a result of post processing or not. Looking at the shadow directly below the tree suggests to me that this photograph was taken in the middle of the day. I would then suggest if your not using a polariser filter to try the shot at different times of the day to see how the light helps to bring out the colours. One other thing, the telephone/power lines can be cloned out legally under advanced editing rules. Hope this helps.</td>', 'This appears to be a little too much blown out. I don''t know if this is a result of post processing or not. Looking at the shadow directly below the tree suggests to me that this photograph was taken in the middle of the day. I would then suggest if your not using a polariser filter to try the shot at different times of the day to see how the light helps to bring out the colours. One other thing, the telephone/power lines can be cloned out legally under advanced editing rules. Hope this helps.', '2009-01-28 03:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223565, 759150, 79806, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset contrasts in temperature with the cold landscape and deadness of the tree. A little blurry and could use sharpening on details of the driftwood.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset contrasts in temperature with the cold landscape and deadness of the tree. A little blurry and could use sharpening on details of the driftwood.', '2009-01-28 04:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223574, 759508, 79806, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette with the muted sun and the colors. I would crop it a little different but that is just personal preference.</td>', 'I like the silhouette with the muted sun and the colors. I would crop it a little different but that is just personal preference.', '2009-01-28 04:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223578, 759649, 79806, '<td valign="top">okay - I love bonsai and blue so this one stood out for me although I think the smoke looks unreal - is it really smoke or is it made in photoshop? if not, I would like to know how you caught it.</td>', 'okay - I love bonsai and blue so this one stood out for me although I think the smoke looks unreal - is it really smoke or is it made in photoshop? if not, I would like to know how you caught it.', '2009-01-28 04:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223591, 758936, 79806, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and mood with the horizon and road. Clouds and sun make it pretty dismal for the tree that wishes he had a mate too like the ones down the road. Colors look almost antique - like a picture from the past.</td>', 'Lovely shot and mood with the horizon and road. Clouds and sun make it pretty dismal for the tree that wishes he had a mate too like the ones down the road. Colors look almost antique - like a picture from the past.', '2009-01-28 04:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223597, 759405, 79806, '<td valign="top">This shot is very well executed - can see the textures and almost feel the plant with your eyes and the colors are very vivid.</td>', 'This shot is very well executed - can see the textures and almost feel the plant with your eyes and the colors are very vivid.', '2009-01-28 04:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223600, 759174, 79806, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture of light and variety of the rocks compared too the rolling hills.</td>', 'Very interesting capture of light and variety of the rocks compared too the rolling hills.', '2009-01-28 04:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223667, 759343, 41439, '<td valign="top">seen a lot of pictures like this one and i think you kinda overcooked it a bit with the editing</td>', 'seen a lot of pictures like this one and i think you kinda overcooked it a bit with the editing', '2009-01-28 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223668, 759402, 41439, '<td valign="top">like this shot :) very well composed and the colours are stunning</td>', 'like this shot :) very well composed and the colours are stunning', '2009-01-28 06:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223808, 759026, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Beautiful tones and colors - and scene.</td>', '8 - Beautiful tones and colors - and scene.', '2009-01-28 08:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223849, 759739, 74979, '<td valign="top">oversharpening hurt this IMO</td>', 'oversharpening hurt this IMO', '2009-01-28 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223904, 759447, 74979, '<td valign="top">over sharpened IMO</td>', 'over sharpened IMO', '2009-01-28 09:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224010, 759712, 69368, '<td valign="top">a really nice idea for this challenge, like also the naturally colors</td>', 'a really nice idea for this challenge, like also the naturally colors', '2009-01-28 10:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224019, 759751, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful image. very well composed and beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful image. very well composed and beautiful colors', '2009-01-28 10:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224024, 759327, 69368, '<td valign="top">one of the best in challenge! Very well composed. - Good luck!</td>', 'one of the best in challenge! Very well composed. - Good luck!', '2009-01-28 10:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224049, 759739, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice negative space that leads my eye to the tree. The tree itself seems like it may be a touch oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice negative space that leads my eye to the tree. The tree itself seems like it may be a touch oversharpened.', '2009-01-28 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224050, 759718, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the sandy soil here. The wisp of a tree doesn''t really stand out from that background much.</td>', 'I like the texture of the sandy soil here. The wisp of a tree doesn''t really stand out from that background much.', '2009-01-28 10:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224058, 758642, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems blurred and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. I can also see some artifacts around the edges of the silhouette. Your file size of only 76k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'This seems blurred and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. I can also see some artifacts around the edges of the silhouette. Your file size of only 76k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-01-28 10:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224062, 759703, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s nice looking as an illustration, I like the way the leaves stand out against the background. If I look at this as a photo, it looks a bit unnatural. (As if overprocessing is an uncommon thing around here, right?) Not sure...</td>', 'It''s nice looking as an illustration, I like the way the leaves stand out against the background. If I look at this as a photo, it looks a bit unnatural. (As if overprocessing is an uncommon thing around here, right?) Not sure...', '2009-01-28 10:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224064, 759188, 83313, '<td valign="top">Strong and simple. Nice b/w treatment.</td>', 'Strong and simple. Nice b/w treatment.', '2009-01-28 10:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224076, 759582, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene, the colors come off to me as a little dull and orangey, however. I think this might have been a great candidate for a nice strong b/w treatment.</td>', 'An interesting scene, the colors come off to me as a little dull and orangey, however. I think this might have been a great candidate for a nice strong b/w treatment.', '2009-01-28 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224079, 759767, 83313, '<td valign="top">Y, you ask? Just because.</td>', 'Y, you ask? Just because.', '2009-01-28 10:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224084, 758957, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like the result of a lightning strike perhaps? It does make for an interesting shot.</td>', 'Looks like the result of a lightning strike perhaps? It does make for an interesting shot.', '2009-01-28 10:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224088, 759584, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is. Looks like a cotton ball with herbs glued to it. A model tree from a diorama?</td>', 'Not sure what this is. Looks like a cotton ball with herbs glued to it. A model tree from a diorama?', '2009-01-28 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224093, 759766, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you intentionally gave this an illustration-like look, or if it is just oversharpened.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you intentionally gave this an illustration-like look, or if it is just oversharpened.', '2009-01-28 10:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224096, 758998, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the detail on the trunk and the 3 dimensional feel this has.</td>', 'I like the detail on the trunk and the 3 dimensional feel this has.', '2009-01-28 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224098, 759729, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene out of a fantasy movie. Excellent. 9 and a fave.</td>', 'Looks like a scene out of a fantasy movie. Excellent. 9 and a fave.', '2009-01-28 10:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224102, 758076, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sketch. This has a very oriental feel to it.</td>', 'Looks like a sketch. This has a very oriental feel to it.', '2009-01-28 10:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224107, 758470, 102994, '<td valign="top">Haha, love it :)</td>', 'Haha, love it :)', '2009-01-28 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224110, 759402, 102994, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous</td>', 'Gorgeous', '2009-01-28 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224124, 759533, 78361, '<td valign="top">Way oversaturated</td>', 'Way oversaturated', '2009-01-28 11:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224383, 759637, 52500, '<td valign="top">There''s some really bizarre processing going on here, which I like immensely. One of my top scores for sure.  The composition isn''t perfect for me (I like me some good negative space, so I would prefer that the tree hug the right edge), so I guess you get a 9 instead of a 10.<br/> <br/>Well, now that I''ve voted the whole thing, this is my #1 choice, so you get a bonus point for that. 10 it is.</td>', 'There''s some really bizarre processing going on here, which I like immensely. One of my top scores for sure.  The composition isn''t perfect for me (I like me some good negative space, so I would prefer that the tree hug the right edge), so I guess you get a 9 instead of a 10. Well, now that I''ve voted the whole thing, this is my #1 choice, so you get a bonus point for that. 10 it is.', '2009-01-28 13:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224424, 759720, 15511, '<td valign="top">Effective colors add much interest here, but the tilt makes the image difficult to look at for extended periods.</td>', 'Effective colors add much interest here, but the tilt makes the image difficult to look at for extended periods.', '2009-01-28 13:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224506, 758520, 15511, '<td valign="top">It''ll get more leaves in he spring...</td>', 'It''ll get more leaves in he spring...', '2009-01-28 14:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224515, 759540, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your processing has resulted in reduced depth and now the foreground blends too easily into the background.</td>', 'Your processing has resulted in reduced depth and now the foreground blends too easily into the background.', '2009-01-28 14:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224607, 759187, 95166, '<td valign="top">love the clouds in the background.</td>', 'love the clouds in the background.', '2009-01-28 15:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224621, 759680, 95166, '<td valign="top">It looks like you tried to lighten the tree and while doing so the the sky behind it is lighter too.</td>', 'It looks like you tried to lighten the tree and while doing so the the sky behind it is lighter too.', '2009-01-28 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224630, 758245, 95166, '<td valign="top">i like the effect on the grass, makes it look really windy. Nice</td>', 'i like the effect on the grass, makes it look really windy. Nice', '2009-01-28 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224833, 759568, 102024, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit</td>', 'Beautifully lit', '2009-01-28 17:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224836, 759402, 102024, '<td valign="top">Excellent lines leading through the photograph.  The Colors are well done and rich yet naturally warm.</td>', 'Excellent lines leading through the photograph.  The Colors are well done and rich yet naturally warm.', '2009-01-28 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224838, 759174, 102024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful find.  Well composed, and despite the deep DOF, nothing is flattened, the landscape speaks for itself.</td>', 'Wonderful find.  Well composed, and despite the deep DOF, nothing is flattened, the landscape speaks for itself.', '2009-01-28 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5224857, 759458, 84124, '<td valign="top">Wow, first one I''m voting on, and I''m sure it''s going to be one of the best, great shot.</td>', 'Wow, first one I''m voting on, and I''m sure it''s going to be one of the best, great shot.', '2009-01-28 17:34:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5225187, 759702, 66041, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but it doesn''t pop.  Maybe lack of contrast?   just looks too grey and blah.</td>', 'I like the composition but it doesn''t pop.  Maybe lack of contrast?   just looks too grey and blah.', '2009-01-28 21:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225335, 758936, 66041, '<td valign="top">Wow.   very very nice.</td>', 'Wow.   very very nice.', '2009-01-28 22:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225629, 759766, 7343, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t seem quite ''single'' enough.  Colors look a little blown out.</td>', 'This one doesn''t seem quite ''single'' enough.  Colors look a little blown out.', '2009-01-29 04:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225630, 758076, 7343, '<td valign="top">Like this one, but maybe not quite enough detail in the leaves/branches.  And to get nitpicky, the horizon is a little tilted.  Nice shot though</td>', 'Like this one, but maybe not quite enough detail in the leaves/branches.  And to get nitpicky, the horizon is a little tilted.  Nice shot though', '2009-01-29 04:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225631, 757985, 7343, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice in this, but the tree seems like it may not capture enough of the focus.</td>', 'The colors are nice in this, but the tree seems like it may not capture enough of the focus.', '2009-01-29 04:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225633, 759671, 7343, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W and contrast.  The hut provides a nice little detail.  Nice that ''3'' trees is really one.</td>', 'I like the B&W and contrast.  The hut provides a nice little detail.  Nice that ''3'' trees is really one.', '2009-01-29 04:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225635, 759395, 7343, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and exposure in this.  One of the few I''ve seen that has more than one tree but still seems to fit the ''single'' tree part.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the colors and exposure in this.  One of the few I''ve seen that has more than one tree but still seems to fit the ''single'' tree part.  Nice shot.', '2009-01-29 04:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225637, 759017, 7343, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice.  I wish you had cropped a bit off the right (the sky is pretty, but the rest is pretty dark and doesn''t add much.)  A square compostion might have looked a little nicer.</td>', 'The colors are very nice.  I wish you had cropped a bit off the right (the sky is pretty, but the rest is pretty dark and doesn''t add much.)  A square compostion might have looked a little nicer.', '2009-01-29 04:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225640, 759582, 7343, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of balancing columns with tree.  Colors are a little wierd to me, but almost work too.  The tree itself seems a little too far right and not a big enough focus for the shot.  Just humble opinion...</td>', 'I like the idea of balancing columns with tree.  Colors are a little wierd to me, but almost work too.  The tree itself seems a little too far right and not a big enough focus for the shot.  Just humble opinion...', '2009-01-29 04:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225641, 759762, 7343, '<td valign="top">Very clever!</td>', 'Very clever!', '2009-01-29 04:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225642, 759179, 7343, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  Maybe a little too dark up top?</td>', 'Very nice colors.  Maybe a little too dark up top?', '2009-01-29 04:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225644, 758594, 7343, '<td valign="top">Did you take this driving?  Done that many times when wife couldn''t/wouldn''t stop...  :)  The blur in foreground is a little distracting.  If you couldn''t stop, maybe crop a bit to get the blurrier parts out?</td>', 'Did you take this driving?  Done that many times when wife couldn''t/wouldn''t stop...  :)  The blur in foreground is a little distracting.  If you couldn''t stop, maybe crop a bit to get the blurrier parts out?', '2009-01-29 04:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225645, 758407, 7343, '<td valign="top">I like the color tone in this one - different than the B&amp;W''s and others I''ve been seeing.  Nicely focused too.  Can''t help wondering what it would look like if that pole was cloned out...  Hate changing the shot too much and not sure that''s allowed here though.  It does lean to the tree anyway.  Very pretty shot.</td>', 'I like the color tone in this one - different than the B&W''s and others I''ve been seeing.  Nicely focused too.  Can''t help wondering what it would look like if that pole was cloned out...  Hate changing the shot too much and not sure that''s allowed here though.  It does lean to the tree anyway.  Very pretty shot.', '2009-01-29 04:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225647, 758228, 7343, '<td valign="top">It might be from processing to submit, but this seems alittle fuzzy.  If it was nice and crisp I''d boost my score a couple points.  I like the solitary nature and background.</td>', 'It might be from processing to submit, but this seems alittle fuzzy.  If it was nice and crisp I''d boost my score a couple points.  I like the solitary nature and background.', '2009-01-29 04:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225649, 758662, 7343, '<td valign="top">This is a very single tree.  I like this shot a lot.  Looks black and white, but hard to tell for sure.  Whatever, it works nicely.</td>', 'This is a very single tree.  I like this shot a lot.  Looks black and white, but hard to tell for sure.  Whatever, it works nicely.', '2009-01-29 04:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225695, 759106, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Ha, gives a good sense of scale.  With your title (and I <i>do</i> get it) - ''if only'' I could see him barking.</td>', '8 - Ha, gives a good sense of scale.  With your title (and I do get it) - ''if only'' I could see him barking.', '2009-01-29 06:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225698, 759251, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Really like those tones and the effect created by the snow covered ground.</td>', '7 - Really like those tones and the effect created by the snow covered ground.', '2009-01-29 06:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225701, 758653, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice image.  Wish it were more about the tree, but then that good ''just'' road element wouldn''t be there..</td>', '7 - Very nice image.  Wish it were more about the tree, but then that good ''just'' road element wouldn''t be there..', '2009-01-29 06:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225821, 758974, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the subject. I feel like the pic isn''t as sharp as it could be - perhaps it''s just compressed from sve to web or perhaps it''s the PP? Wish it were sharper. I also think the tree would pop more if you use the blank background of the sky more than the busy backdrop of the land - perhaps a lower angle.</td>', 'I love the subject. I feel like the pic isn''t as sharp as it could be - perhaps it''s just compressed from sve to web or perhaps it''s the PP? Wish it were sharper. I also think the tree would pop more if you use the blank background of the sky more than the busy backdrop of the land - perhaps a lower angle.', '2009-01-29 09:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225822, 759763, 98141, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, dull subject and composition. For a more "lonely" feeling, perhaps use more empty space in the pic? This feels overly crowded to me.</td>', 'Good DOF, dull subject and composition. For a more "lonely" feeling, perhaps use more empty space in the pic? This feels overly crowded to me.', '2009-01-29 09:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225824, 759532, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and great composition! I love this, well done.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and great composition! I love this, well done.', '2009-01-29 09:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225826, 759368, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pic, the scope is grand and I love the colors. I don''t feel that the tree itself is symmetrical enough to really pop with center positioning, I would prefer it off to a side.</td>', 'This is a nice pic, the scope is grand and I love the colors. I don''t feel that the tree itself is symmetrical enough to really pop with center positioning, I would prefer it off to a side.', '2009-01-29 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225831, 759180, 98141, '<td valign="top">The way the clouds are light-colored behind the dark silhouette of the tree and dark in the other part of the sky works so well here. I love the slight blur. I think a closer crop on the bottom would make this even more powerful.</td>', 'The way the clouds are light-colored behind the dark silhouette of the tree and dark in the other part of the sky works so well here. I love the slight blur. I think a closer crop on the bottom would make this even more powerful.', '2009-01-29 09:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225832, 759758, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a little brighter, the top of the pic seems so much darker than the bottom. Cool subject and nice angle, but a very simple pic.</td>', 'I wish this were a little brighter, the top of the pic seems so much darker than the bottom. Cool subject and nice angle, but a very simple pic.', '2009-01-29 10:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225835, 758936, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous. I love the colors and the composition. Not much to say other than that - I really enjoy it. Good job.</td>', 'This is fabulous. I love the colors and the composition. Not much to say other than that - I really enjoy it. Good job.', '2009-01-29 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225841, 759568, 98141, '<td valign="top">The lighting feels really forced to me and the background is a little busy near the top of the tree. I''d like it better if the horizon were lower perhaps.</td>', 'The lighting feels really forced to me and the background is a little busy near the top of the tree. I''d like it better if the horizon were lower perhaps.', '2009-01-29 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226011, 759653, 102024, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.  Well composed.  I almost wish there was even more undulation in the landscape, though.  But  still a great shot.</td>', 'Breathtaking.  Well composed.  I almost wish there was even more undulation in the landscape, though.  But  still a great shot.', '2009-01-29 12:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226211, 759764, 39427, '<td valign="top">simple yet effective</td>', 'simple yet effective', '2009-01-29 15:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226212, 759729, 39427, '<td valign="top">dramatic and very nice, great editing</td>', 'dramatic and very nice, great editing', '2009-01-29 15:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226219, 759653, 39427, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2009-01-29 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226221, 759656, 39427, '<td valign="top">love it, 8</td>', 'love it, 8', '2009-01-29 15:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
