(5226975, 758470, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, HO! This is beyond terrific, in the context of the challenge! Photographically it''s nothing to write home about, of course, but its banal *ordinariness* is the major component of its startling impact, if that makes any sense at all. I''d LOVE to see this image ribbon, though I have scant hope it will.</td>', 'Oh, HO! This is beyond terrific, in the context of the challenge! Photographically it''s nothing to write home about, of course, but its banal *ordinariness* is the major component of its startling impact, if that makes any sense at all. I''d LOVE to see this image ribbon, though I have scant hope it will.', '2009-01-30 01:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226995, 758407, 44751, '<td valign="top">Just a gorgeous soft glow/focus feel to this one, but still maintaining a sharpness to the subject.  Strong subject.  DPC loves a flat horizon and this horizon isn''t flat, so I predict you''ll be chipped about that.  I give it an 8.  Good luck.</td>', 'Just a gorgeous soft glow/focus feel to this one, but still maintaining a sharpness to the subject.  Strong subject.  DPC loves a flat horizon and this horizon isn''t flat, so I predict you''ll be chipped about that.  I give it an 8.  Good luck.', '2009-01-30 03:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
