(5227030, 759720, 15407, '<td valign="top">For me the composure and crop diminishes the potential for this photo.  I would have voted this 3 point''s higher had it been captured with a plumb tree trunk and more of the remaining sunset/sunrise.</td>', 'For me the composure and crop diminishes the potential for this photo.  I would have voted this 3 point''s higher had it been captured with a plumb tree trunk and more of the remaining sunset/sunrise.', '2009-01-30 05:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
