(5227045, 757839, 63633, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something a bit different. Well done.</td>', 'Nice to see something a bit different. Well done.', '2009-01-30 05:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227199, 759272, 91282, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better if it were cropped a little closer to the tree.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better if it were cropped a little closer to the tree.', '2009-01-30 10:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227212, 759655, 91282, '<td valign="top">Have you seen the movie ''The Illusionist''? That looks exactly like the tree that the boy meets the mysterious blind magician under. Very cool. :)</td>', 'Have you seen the movie ''The Illusionist''? That looks exactly like the tree that the boy meets the mysterious blind magician under. Very cool. :)', '2009-01-30 10:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227446, 759174, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of foreground, and very well balanced in light/shado/composition.  What I like best, though, is the angle of the poor tree - what a harsh environment, yet it''s there.  Great location - ''grats on making great use of it, too.</td>', 'Excellent use of foreground, and very well balanced in light/shado/composition.  What I like best, though, is the angle of the poor tree - what a harsh environment, yet it''s there.  Great location - ''grats on making great use of it, too.', '2009-01-30 14:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227448, 758245, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the quiet toning of this - it serves this poor stick of a tree well.</td>', 'I really like the quiet toning of this - it serves this poor stick of a tree well.', '2009-01-30 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227450, 759231, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the "upsweep" of the clouds - emphasizes the tall, lean nature of the tree.  Good tone and color as well.</td>', 'I like the "upsweep" of the clouds - emphasizes the tall, lean nature of the tree.  Good tone and color as well.', '2009-01-30 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227451, 759628, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good combo of high contrast, nifty angle/perspective, and the bird of course makes the shot.</td>', 'Good combo of high contrast, nifty angle/perspective, and the bird of course makes the shot.', '2009-01-30 14:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227453, 759620, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too busy for the masses I fear, but I really like this.  I especially like that despite the busy aspect, there does appear to be only this one tree in the neighborhood, in an isolated bit of what was once farmland and desperately trying to hang on, depsite what appears to be suburbia creeping in on every side.</td>', 'Too busy for the masses I fear, but I really like this.  I especially like that despite the busy aspect, there does appear to be only this one tree in the neighborhood, in an isolated bit of what was once farmland and desperately trying to hang on, depsite what appears to be suburbia creeping in on every side.', '2009-01-30 14:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227473, 759106, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOVE the dog!!  Sadly, there are those who will miss it.  Excellet use of what I suspect is wide angle or fisheye (?) or so it seems, and love the detail in the texture.  Delightfully fun shot!</td>', 'LOVE the dog!!  Sadly, there are those who will miss it.  Excellet use of what I suspect is wide angle or fisheye (?) or so it seems, and love the detail in the texture.  Delightfully fun shot!', '2009-01-30 14:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227476, 759769, 30982, '<td valign="top">Barren but not sadly so.  More of a kind of quiet aloneness, I think.  I''m not usually fond of overdoing vignetting, but I think you''ve used it to good effect here.</td>', 'Barren but not sadly so.  More of a kind of quiet aloneness, I think.  I''m not usually fond of overdoing vignetting, but I think you''ve used it to good effect here.', '2009-01-30 14:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227478, 759034, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like your choice to put the tree in context.  Almost as though this is the guardian of the farm.  Not a big tree, but he''s spread his branches out to encompass and protect the place.  And dang, it looks cold!</td>', 'I really like your choice to put the tree in context.  Almost as though this is the guardian of the farm.  Not a big tree, but he''s spread his branches out to encompass and protect the place.  And dang, it looks cold!', '2009-01-30 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227481, 759734, 30982, '<td valign="top">Stark and well toned to add to that stark feeling.</td>', 'Stark and well toned to add to that stark feeling.', '2009-01-30 14:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227486, 759671, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this tree before, but maybe just one similar.  Or it reminds me of a tree I''ve seen before.  At any rate, I like the tree, I like your presentation of the tree.  Technicals are excellent and I like the inclusion of the small hut and the people in it.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this tree before, but maybe just one similar.  Or it reminds me of a tree I''ve seen before.  At any rate, I like the tree, I like your presentation of the tree.  Technicals are excellent and I like the inclusion of the small hut and the people in it.', '2009-01-30 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227488, 759655, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cows!  Idyllic setting, nice play with the light, very good use of the "S" curve and good overall balance/composition.  But then, I suspect you know all of that, so I''ll just go with "cows!"</td>', 'Cows!  Idyllic setting, nice play with the light, very good use of the "S" curve and good overall balance/composition.  But then, I suspect you know all of that, so I''ll just go with "cows!"', '2009-01-30 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227492, 759625, 30982, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully shaped tree and a perfect sky to accentuate it''s reaching arms.</td>', 'A wonderfully shaped tree and a perfect sky to accentuate it''s reaching arms.', '2009-01-30 14:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227495, 759667, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the diva and her handmaindens are leaning away from each other - almost as though they''ve been banished for doing something wrong.</td>', 'I like how the diva and her handmaindens are leaning away from each other - almost as though they''ve been banished for doing something wrong.', '2009-01-30 14:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227496, 758653, 30982, '<td valign="top">Amazing how these things can find ways to hang in there against all odds.  I like the subtle coloration in this.</td>', 'Amazing how these things can find ways to hang in there against all odds.  I like the subtle coloration in this.', '2009-01-30 14:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227498, 759368, 30982, '<td valign="top">My favorite minimalist tree in the challenge - I really like the way you''ve brought out the color and texture in the foreground.</td>', 'My favorite minimalist tree in the challenge - I really like the way you''ve brought out the color and texture in the foreground.', '2009-01-30 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227501, 759623, 30982, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few winter trees against stark skies, but this one works better than most and I''ll be darned if I know why.</td>', 'There are quite a few winter trees against stark skies, but this one works better than most and I''ll be darned if I know why.', '2009-01-30 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227504, 758599, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the dark to light bottom to top effect here, and I really like the shape of the tree.  You found a good one.</td>', 'I like the dark to light bottom to top effect here, and I really like the shape of the tree.  You found a good one.', '2009-01-30 14:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227507, 759251, 30982, '<td valign="top">An elegant tree, and I suspect a long exposure to give the smoothness of the snow (blowing snow, maybe?) and the sky.  If I may pick one small nit - just a WEE bit more space on the right to get in that last bit of branch.  But overall a very pleasing shot indeed.</td>', 'An elegant tree, and I suspect a long exposure to give the smoothness of the snow (blowing snow, maybe?) and the sky.  If I may pick one small nit - just a WEE bit more space on the right to get in that last bit of branch.  But overall a very pleasing shot indeed.', '2009-01-30 14:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227548, 759534, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do think this does meet the challenge in a novel way, and I think your presentation could be stronger with an increase in brightness/levels.</td>', 'I do think this does meet the challenge in a novel way, and I think your presentation could be stronger with an increase in brightness/levels.', '2009-01-30 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227549, 758372, 30982, '<td valign="top">I interpret this, by your title, to indicate the poor tree is stuck between buildings in an industrialized zone somewhere, when it would rpobably really prefer to be elsewhere.  It loosely meets the challenge, but the tree doesn''t appear to be you primary subject - I focus more on the door, which has its own intrigue.</td>', 'I interpret this, by your title, to indicate the poor tree is stuck between buildings in an industrialized zone somewhere, when it would rpobably really prefer to be elsewhere.  It loosely meets the challenge, but the tree doesn''t appear to be you primary subject - I focus more on the door, which has its own intrigue.', '2009-01-30 14:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227551, 759718, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting approach to the challenge with good color and focus, but your subject is just a little too good at blending in with its surroundings in this case.</td>', 'I think this is an interesting approach to the challenge with good color and focus, but your subject is just a little too good at blending in with its surroundings in this case.', '2009-01-30 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227553, 759766, 30982, '<td valign="top">''Tis a well shaped tree but conditions were a bit harsh as far as lighting for this shot, in my opinion.  Shooting when the light is a bit lower in the sky tends to provide more detail, more shape.  Some may not care for the power lines.  In advanced, they can be cloned, but it''s a pain in the derriere (at least for me.)</td>', '''Tis a well shaped tree but conditions were a bit harsh as far as lighting for this shot, in my opinion.  Shooting when the light is a bit lower in the sky tends to provide more detail, more shape.  Some may not care for the power lines.  In advanced, they can be cloned, but it''s a pain in the derriere (at least for me.)', '2009-01-30 14:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227564, 759164, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a bit smaller than the size allowed for challenge entries, particularly for the advanced edit ruleset.  There''s a good tutorial under the "Learn" section for sizing pictures for challenge submission - you do want to take full advantage of the size you''re allowed so people can see your photographs better.</td>', 'This is a bit smaller than the size allowed for challenge entries, particularly for the advanced edit ruleset.  There''s a good tutorial under the "Learn" section for sizing pictures for challenge submission - you do want to take full advantage of the size you''re allowed so people can see your photographs better.', '2009-01-30 14:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227565, 758699, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m all for blur and OOF, Lensbabies and pinholes.  This one has a nice form, but I find myself wanting more for some reason.</td>', 'I''m all for blur and OOF, Lensbabies and pinholes.  This one has a nice form, but I find myself wanting more for some reason.', '2009-01-30 14:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227569, 759401, 30982, '<td valign="top">This seems to me a little "flat" in that a bit of adjustment in curves or levels will bring out the contrasts and colors a bit more.</td>', 'This seems to me a little "flat" in that a bit of adjustment in curves or levels will bring out the contrasts and colors a bit more.', '2009-01-30 14:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227658, 759402, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice composition and beautiful light.</td>', '8 - Nice composition and beautiful light.', '2009-01-30 15:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227662, 758978, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really like the shape of this tree, and the barest bit of ground included.  Perhaps a bit too sharp for my taste.</td>', 'Really like the shape of this tree, and the barest bit of ground included.  Perhaps a bit too sharp for my taste.', '2009-01-30 15:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227663, 759720, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky and I like the marching rows of stalks come across the field.  Not totall sold on the tilt but it does lend to the attack of those stalks...</td>', 'Gorgeous sky and I like the marching rows of stalks come across the field.  Not totall sold on the tilt but it does lend to the attack of those stalks...', '2009-01-30 15:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
