(5227666, 759565, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure why I like this, but I do.  It''s quiet, it''s thoughtful, and it does make me wonder why half the tree isn''t quite there.  I like the muted feel of this, too.</td>', 'Not sure why I like this, but I do.  It''s quiet, it''s thoughtful, and it does make me wonder why half the tree isn''t quite there.  I like the muted feel of this, too.', '2009-01-30 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227771, 759653, 85102, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2009-01-30 17:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227773, 759703, 103142, '<td valign="top">wonderful!  but this is my favorite so far. (by quite a bit!) I love it being all shades of the same color. It''s muted, yet the leaves still glow.</td>', 'wonderful!  but this is my favorite so far. (by quite a bit!) I love it being all shades of the same color. It''s muted, yet the leaves still glow.', '2009-01-30 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227774, 759568, 103142, '<td valign="top">very nicely done!</td>', 'very nicely done!', '2009-01-30 17:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227775, 759250, 103142, '<td valign="top">very nicely done!</td>', 'very nicely done!', '2009-01-30 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227777, 759680, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the photo very much... however, the white glow behind the tree looks unnatural. If it was a fluke of nature, sorry! If you lightened it to bring the tree out, it''s a little overdone.<br/> <br/>overall still very nice!</td>', 'I like the photo very much... however, the white glow behind the tree looks unnatural. If it was a fluke of nature, sorry! If you lightened it to bring the tree out, it''s a little overdone. overall still very nice!', '2009-01-30 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227780, 758654, 103142, '<td valign="top">nice shot, fun idea.</td>', 'nice shot, fun idea.', '2009-01-30 17:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227784, 759095, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice tree; it has lots of character. however, I wish the tree fit in the frame. It gives the impression that you couldn''t move back any farther (or zoom out), and that it just didn''t fit. I''d either crop more or less.</td>', 'Very nice tree; it has lots of character. however, I wish the tree fit in the frame. It gives the impression that you couldn''t move back any farther (or zoom out), and that it just didn''t fit. I''d either crop more or less.', '2009-01-30 17:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227792, 759395, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this very much! I find it extremely pleasing for some reason--it just calls to me. I couldn''t decide between 9 and 10, so I gave it a 10.<br/> <br/>One small thing... It looked like you decided to crop it to a 5x7 proportion. I''m curious what it would have looked like if it was cropped in a little more from the right...</td>', 'I like this very much! I find it extremely pleasing for some reason--it just calls to me. I couldn''t decide between 9 and 10, so I gave it a 10. One small thing... It looked like you decided to crop it to a 5x7 proportion. I''m curious what it would have looked like if it was cropped in a little more from the right...', '2009-01-30 17:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227796, 759138, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, but I wish there was more definition to the tree. With the fog, I''d be happier with everything a little more washed out and get a little detail back on the tree.</td>', 'I like this very much, but I wish there was more definition to the tree. With the fog, I''d be happier with everything a little more washed out and get a little detail back on the tree.', '2009-01-30 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227798, 759718, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the tree really gets lost in the photo. Would a lower angle separate the tree from the background and give it a little more definition.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the tree really gets lost in the photo. Would a lower angle separate the tree from the background and give it a little more definition.', '2009-01-30 17:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227800, 759675, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this very, very much--and gave it a ten. However, I think the frame was a big mistake for this picture. It is a very soft picture, even with the tree. The frame keeps bringing my attention out of the picture and I''m finding it very distracting. I couldn''t rate it down because of that, though, because I enjoyed the picture too much.</td>', 'I like this very, very much--and gave it a ten. However, I think the frame was a big mistake for this picture. It is a very soft picture, even with the tree. The frame keeps bringing my attention out of the picture and I''m finding it very distracting. I couldn''t rate it down because of that, though, because I enjoyed the picture too much.', '2009-01-30 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227803, 759032, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, it''s an interesting tree, but I feel that there''s not enough contrast between the tree and the building. The trunk disappears into the building, and it makes the tree top seem to float--it''s disconcerting. Would an angle more to the right have set it off more?</td>', 'I''m sorry, it''s an interesting tree, but I feel that there''s not enough contrast between the tree and the building. The trunk disappears into the building, and it makes the tree top seem to float--it''s disconcerting. Would an angle more to the right have set it off more?', '2009-01-30 17:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227812, 758228, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the tree and the sky, but I found it way too blurry. Also, I would have found it more interesting without losing the top and left of the tree. So little of it is out of the picture, it looks like it couldn''t fit instead of a cropping choice. I think if the focus was sharp it would have been very nice.</td>', 'I love the tree and the sky, but I found it way too blurry. Also, I would have found it more interesting without losing the top and left of the tree. So little of it is out of the picture, it looks like it couldn''t fit instead of a cropping choice. I think if the focus was sharp it would have been very nice.', '2009-01-30 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227815, 759446, 103142, '<td valign="top">very nice. funny thing is, I really couldn''t decide whether I liked the bird or not! I enjoyed seeing the picture.</td>', 'very nice. funny thing is, I really couldn''t decide whether I liked the bird or not! I enjoyed seeing the picture.', '2009-01-30 17:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227820, 759034, 103142, '<td valign="top">I liked this very much, but even though the tree was the focus of the challenge, I still didn''t care for it centered. I would have liked it much better off a little to the left.</td>', 'I liked this very much, but even though the tree was the focus of the challenge, I still didn''t care for it centered. I would have liked it much better off a little to the left.', '2009-01-30 17:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
