(5231043, 759582, 99412, '<td valign="top">Now when I look at this photo, I think to myself, this photographer decided to try something different. Something creative. I have a feeling that at least one person is going to say something similar to this. (The PILLARS are DIS..TRACTING my VIEEEEEEWWWWWWW).  "OR"  .  (The SUBJECT of the CHALLENGEEEE is SUPPPP...POOOOOSED TO BE the TREEEEEEEEEE.......Not the PILLARSSSS).<br/>:)<br/>The tree is very nice and the pillars give this entry a lot of character.<br/> <br/>Oh yes, I almost forgot to mention the voter who might say something like this......(You KNOWWWW, if it were not for that distracting LITTLE PEB..BLE... sitting RIGHT next to that bigger rock, this photo might have scored much higher.<br/>:)<br/>I hope this one does well as I will be scoring it high when I vote.<br/>:)</td>', 'Now when I look at this photo, I think to myself, this photographer decided to try something different. Something creative. I have a feeling that at least one person is going to say something similar to this. (The PILLARS are DIS..TRACTING my VIEEEEEEWWWWWWW).  "OR"  .  (The SUBJECT of the CHALLENGEEEE is SUPPPP...POOOOOSED TO BE the TREEEEEEEEEE.......Not the PILLARSSSS).:)The tree is very nice and the pillars give this entry a lot of character. Oh yes, I almost forgot to mention the voter who might say something like this......(You KNOWWWW, if it were not for that distracting LITTLE PEB..BLE... sitting RIGHT next to that bigger rock, this photo might have scored much higher.:)I hope this one does well as I will be scoring it high when I vote.:)', '2009-02-01 09:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
