(5234315, 759771, 53964, '<td valign="top">And for me the busyness is part of the appeal. My eye immediately goes to the tree and gazebo then the bench and people, so there''s no doubt what the main subject is, but then I enjoyed looking at the little details that add up to a lovely setting. I gave you an 8.</td>', 'And for me the busyness is part of the appeal. My eye immediately goes to the tree and gazebo then the bench and people, so there''s no doubt what the main subject is, but then I enjoyed looking at the little details that add up to a lovely setting. I gave you an 8.', '2009-02-02 03:33:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5234317, 759582, 53964, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 8''s. The colour gives an almost post-apocolyptic feel,  and yet the tree still survives. The darkness of it makes it a strong focal point. Every time I look at the shot I first look at the columns, of course, but it doesn''t take long for my eye to go back to the tree and stay there longer. Every time, even when I try to keep looking at the columns.  <br/> <br/>I like :)<br/> <br/>eta after another look; the total blankness of the background, as if it''s the ends of the earth, add to the feeling of isolaton and desolation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-10 14:55:36.</i></td>', 'I was one of your 8''s. The colour gives an almost post-apocolyptic feel,  and yet the tree still survives. The darkness of it makes it a strong focal point. Every time I look at the shot I first look at the columns, of course, but it doesn''t take long for my eye to go back to the tree and stay there longer. Every time, even when I try to keep looking at the columns.   I like :) eta after another look; the total blankness of the background, as if it''s the ends of the earth, add to the feeling of isolaton and desolation.', '2009-02-02 03:38:26.000000', '2009-02-10 14:55:36.000000', 0),
