(5234746, 758470, 101730, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Been working my way down from first to last place in this challenge, and this is the first picture since about no. 50 that''s really caught my eye. It''s a great find in it''s own right, but you also managed to make the best use of the available elements (the arrow on the road) to make the picture as photograpically interesting and esthetically pleasing as possible considering the mundaneness of the location. Agree with everyone else that this should''ve scored much higher, preferably above a lot of the tree-with-sunset pictures.</td>', 'Hahaha! Been working my way down from first to last place in this challenge, and this is the first picture since about no. 50 that''s really caught my eye. It''s a great find in it''s own right, but you also managed to make the best use of the available elements (the arrow on the road) to make the picture as photograpically interesting and esthetically pleasing as possible considering the mundaneness of the location. Agree with everyone else that this should''ve scored much higher, preferably above a lot of the tree-with-sunset pictures.', '2009-02-02 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
