(5235283, 759713, 16531, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basssman7:</b></div><hr/><i> This has got to be a frozen tree by Niagara Falls.  Great shot.  Drag about the DQ. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes it is  right in front of the Falls,a new shape every day depending in the wind .<br/>The tree is right in between two street lights,tough not to get them in the shot.  <br/>The purple back ground is the mist with the  purple light lighting the Falls <br/>I removed a snow bank and cloned a funky light spot in the front<br/>I should have read the rules:)Lets just call it a brain freeze !! <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by basssman7: This has got to be a frozen tree by Niagara Falls.  Great shot.  Drag about the DQ.   Yes it is  right in front of the Falls,a new shape every day depending in the wind .The tree is right in between two street lights,tough not to get them in the shot.  The purple back ground is the mist with the  purple light lighting the Falls I removed a snow bank and cloned a funky light spot in the frontI should have read the rules:)Lets just call it a brain freeze !! ', '2009-02-02 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
