(5235884, 758936, 22301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on you completing your set of ribbons Deb! I made this little ribbon for you. <img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/22301/800/762233.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/22301/800/762233.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/22301/800/762233.gif"/> :-)<br/>I am glad that sharpening technique worked well for you. I am trying it out in the FS. Does wonders for those small details. For those interested it is exactly what Deb says.<br/>Resize your image to 1000-1500 pixels.<br/>Run Filter-&gt;Sharpen, 1 to 3 times.<br/>Resize to DPC dimensions. Thats it!</td>', 'Congrats on you completing your set of ribbons Deb! I made this little ribbon for you.  :-)I am glad that sharpening technique worked well for you. I am trying it out in the FS. Does wonders for those small details. For those interested it is exactly what Deb says.Resize your image to 1000-1500 pixels.Run Filter->Sharpen, 1 to 3 times.Resize to DPC dimensions. Thats it!', '2009-02-02 19:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
