(5236033, 759179, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, Jeb, the color is fabulous -- not at all the average orange and black sunset silhouette. I doesn''t look very natural to me, but that doesn''t matter to me. I''m not one who thinks a photographic image has to be as the camera sees it. I prefer what the artist sees.</td>', 'Wow, Jeb, the color is fabulous -- not at all the average orange and black sunset silhouette. I doesn''t look very natural to me, but that doesn''t matter to me. I''m not one who thinks a photographic image has to be as the camera sees it. I prefer what the artist sees.', '2009-02-02 20:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5236036, 758065, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool title. The way you have it cropped really makes it look like the tree is trying to block my passage to the mountain.</td>', 'Cool title. The way you have it cropped really makes it look like the tree is trying to block my passage to the mountain.', '2009-02-02 20:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5236045, 759187, 66384, '<td valign="top">I agree with you about the bottom of the clouds being the true horizontal indicator. Therefore I would rotate the image just slightly counterclockwise to get that line straight. The color is spectacular and I love the bright white trunk of the tree. Very pretty image.</td>', 'I agree with you about the bottom of the clouds being the true horizontal indicator. Therefore I would rotate the image just slightly counterclockwise to get that line straight. The color is spectacular and I love the bright white trunk of the tree. Very pretty image.', '2009-02-02 20:58:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5236047, 759578, 66384, '<td valign="top">Magnificent tree. Good basis for a Christmas card.</td>', 'Magnificent tree. Good basis for a Christmas card.', '2009-02-02 21:01:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5236050, 759034, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love this scene. I wouldn''t have thought of shooting the tree with the barn behind it. I probably would have tried to get the tree against the sky. That''s why you''re the artist and I''m the photo hobbyist. BTW, Larry loves this shot too.</td>', 'Love this scene. I wouldn''t have thought of shooting the tree with the barn behind it. I probably would have tried to get the tree against the sky. That''s why you''re the artist and I''m the photo hobbyist. BTW, Larry loves this shot too.', '2009-02-02 21:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
