(5237253, 759032, 30982, '<td valign="top">One wonders sometimes when building planners and landscapers do their thing if they really take into consideration time and the fact trees are living, growing things.  He seems to have enough room, but perhaps just barely.  On the other hand, his height fills the view from within, which is probably a nice thing.  It''s amazing how much snow he''s holding, too.  (And I note you have Inngangs instead of Eingangs.)</td>', 'One wonders sometimes when building planners and landscapers do their thing if they really take into consideration time and the fact trees are living, growing things.  He seems to have enough room, but perhaps just barely.  On the other hand, his height fills the view from within, which is probably a nice thing.  It''s amazing how much snow he''s holding, too.  (And I note you have Inngangs instead of Eingangs.)', '2009-02-03 15:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237260, 758519, 30982, '<td valign="top">This very much reminds me of Bear''s marshes - now I know why!  Lovely work with the processing, but a very gorgeous shot to begin with as well.  I really like how the tree, even though no longer living, still serves a very useful purpose, and I like the warmth of this - a picture of a dead tree but full of life!</td>', 'This very much reminds me of Bear''s marshes - now I know why!  Lovely work with the processing, but a very gorgeous shot to begin with as well.  I really like how the tree, even though no longer living, still serves a very useful purpose, and I like the warmth of this - a picture of a dead tree but full of life!', '2009-02-03 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237264, 758372, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m still intrigued by the door.  I wonder how many people know it''s there, or have ever used it.  And the more I think about it, it''s kind of sad that the tree doesn''t know it''s there either.</td>', 'I''m still intrigued by the door.  I wonder how many people know it''s there, or have ever used it.  And the more I think about it, it''s kind of sad that the tree doesn''t know it''s there either.', '2009-02-03 15:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237268, 759395, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet, sweet light!  ''Tis the stuff photographers live for, and you took fine advantage of it.  I really like the way the clouds are moving across from the right - follows the bends and curves of your tree.</td>', 'Sweet, sweet light!  ''Tis the stuff photographers live for, and you took fine advantage of it.  I really like the way the clouds are moving across from the right - follows the bends and curves of your tree.', '2009-02-03 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237272, 759763, 30982, '<td valign="top">This, to me, is one of the neat things about trees.  They have a life cycle like the rest of us, but are useful throughout, which can''t always be said about the rest of us.  Even in death they serve a purpose.  I''m sure a whole host of insects reside here, and birds stop by to feed on those insects.  And as it decays, it replenishes the earth from which it came.</td>', 'This, to me, is one of the neat things about trees.  They have a life cycle like the rest of us, but are useful throughout, which can''t always be said about the rest of us.  Even in death they serve a purpose.  I''m sure a whole host of insects reside here, and birds stop by to feed on those insects.  And as it decays, it replenishes the earth from which it came.', '2009-02-03 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237274, 759618, 30982, '<td valign="top">Truly gorgeous winter light.  The kind of light that ONLY exists in winter - cold, clean, crisp, with that tinge of pink.  ''Tis really a very pretty tree - the simple, centered composition shows it off quite nicely.</td>', 'Truly gorgeous winter light.  The kind of light that ONLY exists in winter - cold, clean, crisp, with that tinge of pink.  ''Tis really a very pretty tree - the simple, centered composition shows it off quite nicely.', '2009-02-03 15:51:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237276, 759734, 30982, '<td valign="top">WAY underappreciated.  This was one of my favorites in the challenge.  As I said, lovely and stark presentation which suits this tree perfectly.</td>', 'WAY underappreciated.  This was one of my favorites in the challenge.  As I said, lovely and stark presentation which suits this tree perfectly.', '2009-02-03 15:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237280, 759251, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great score, great finish!  And I really love what you did with this tree.  :-)  Seriously, the editing is perfect to create the mood, the flow, the sheer elegance of the tree''s form.  Really nice work!</td>', 'Great score, great finish!  And I really love what you did with this tree.  :-)  Seriously, the editing is perfect to create the mood, the flow, the sheer elegance of the tree''s form.  Really nice work!', '2009-02-03 15:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237281, 759034, 30982, '<td valign="top">Easily should have been top ten, in my opinion.  This would make a gorgeous print.</td>', 'Easily should have been top ten, in my opinion.  This would make a gorgeous print.', '2009-02-03 15:55:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237284, 759017, 30982, '<td valign="top">PERFECT framing to get that sun where you did and what a spectacular way to "light" your tree!  I really like how the sky is so natural, with the light just slipping through here and there.  And tis a gorgeous tree, too - very regal.  ''Grats on the excellent score and a new entry in your top row!</td>', 'PERFECT framing to get that sun where you did and what a spectacular way to "light" your tree!  I really like how the sky is so natural, with the light just slipping through here and there.  And tis a gorgeous tree, too - very regal.  ''Grats on the excellent score and a new entry in your top row!', '2009-02-03 15:57:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237289, 759184, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, the poor thing must be lonely!  I like your choice of composition - it''s minimal in a way - but has plenty of texture and interest at the same time.  I like the wee hints of clouds and the stubble poking through the snow.  Very nice "winter" blue of the sky, too.</td>', 'Oh, the poor thing must be lonely!  I like your choice of composition - it''s minimal in a way - but has plenty of texture and interest at the same time.  I like the wee hints of clouds and the stubble poking through the snow.  Very nice "winter" blue of the sky, too.', '2009-02-03 16:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237291, 758699, 65319, '<td valign="top">I immediately thought of the vase picture or two people kissing, but I see someone beat me to that observation.  I like your use of complementary colors of the yellow and blue as well.  You are having fun with this one!  ;-)</td>', 'I immediately thought of the vase picture or two people kissing, but I see someone beat me to that observation.  I like your use of complementary colors of the yellow and blue as well.  You are having fun with this one!  ;-)', '2009-02-03 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237299, 759667, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bob''s opinion is never useless and he''s right about the underappreciation part.  Well, not underappreciated, really - those of us that like it really do like it.  So it IS appreciated.  Marvelously balanced in story and composition and I thank you for seeing it and sharing it with us.</td>', 'Bob''s opinion is never useless and he''s right about the underappreciation part.  Well, not underappreciated, really - those of us that like it really do like it.  So it IS appreciated.  Marvelously balanced in story and composition and I thank you for seeing it and sharing it with us.', '2009-02-03 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237307, 759179, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Just reading your notes - did you quilt the thing or what?  (Patch tool....)  Great color gradation, lovely clean composition, and I love that royal blue at the top.</td>', 'Heh!  Just reading your notes - did you quilt the thing or what?  (Patch tool....)  Great color gradation, lovely clean composition, and I love that royal blue at the top.', '2009-02-03 16:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237322, 758065, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous - I particularly like the way the mountain is misted as it creates a sense of separation.  And the tree is the only one of its kind in view.  Very well composed, and definitely works in B&amp;W.</td>', 'This is gorgeous - I particularly like the way the mountain is misted as it creates a sense of separation.  And the tree is the only one of its kind in view.  Very well composed, and definitely works in B&W.', '2009-02-03 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237329, 758957, 30982, '<td valign="top">Most definitely meets the challenge as there''s no doubt your straggly tree is the main subject.  I suspect he''s been hit by lightning, but it appears he has weathered it well.  Excellent detail, particularly in the trunk.  And the starkness of the plain sky really suits your tree.  This is a very good shot, in my opinion.</td>', 'Most definitely meets the challenge as there''s no doubt your straggly tree is the main subject.  I suspect he''s been hit by lightning, but it appears he has weathered it well.  Excellent detail, particularly in the trunk.  And the starkness of the plain sky really suits your tree.  This is a very good shot, in my opinion.', '2009-02-03 16:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237335, 759187, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is just fine - the land slopes that way, your tree grows straight.  :-)  I LOVE the colors in this and the sky is amazing - that line of low clouds with the light is hitting them is wonderful, especially that wee bit reflected in the pond.  Really nice work with this one, Brian, from seeing it in the first place to the capture through the processing.</td>', 'Your horizon is just fine - the land slopes that way, your tree grows straight.  :-)  I LOVE the colors in this and the sky is amazing - that line of low clouds with the light is hitting them is wonderful, especially that wee bit reflected in the pond.  Really nice work with this one, Brian, from seeing it in the first place to the capture through the processing.', '2009-02-03 16:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237339, 759578, 30982, '<td valign="top">The first word that comes to mind is "majestic".  Some trees simply have a commanding presence and this is one of them.  LOVE the light in this, and the way it shows off the prevailing direction of the wind, with all the snow on one side of the tree.  Wow.  Just looked at your score - way lower than I thought it would be.  Ignore it.  Much better picture than that.</td>', 'The first word that comes to mind is "majestic".  Some trees simply have a commanding presence and this is one of them.  LOVE the light in this, and the way it shows off the prevailing direction of the wind, with all the snow on one side of the tree.  Wow.  Just looked at your score - way lower than I thought it would be.  Ignore it.  Much better picture than that.', '2009-02-03 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237487, 759644, 51269, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one in the challenge, Marion- it''s a gorgeous tree silouhette- this challenge fell flat for me :)</td>', 'I really liked this one in the challenge, Marion- it''s a gorgeous tree silouhette- this challenge fell flat for me :)', '2009-02-03 17:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237624, 759174, 102429, '<td valign="top">This is a really pretty picture. Good Job!</td>', 'This is a really pretty picture. Good Job!', '2009-02-03 19:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237639, 759402, 102429, '<td valign="top">The sky is really pretty.  Nice shot!</td>', 'The sky is really pretty.  Nice shot!', '2009-02-03 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5237681, 758936, 72670, '<td valign="top">Love this! The composition and the processing is spot on for this. Definitely looks better with that ribbon beside the title.<br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Love this! The composition and the processing is spot on for this. Definitely looks better with that ribbon beside the title.Congrats!', '2009-02-03 20:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
