(5239436, 759754, 98339, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by liberty:</b></div><hr/><i> No, I don''t think so...its on the corner of pucker and pokagon....I Love all the sky! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ya...that''s it...look in my profile  how did you get the water/irragation line out of the photo???  It''s a wonderful tree!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-04 15:24:47.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by liberty: No, I don''t think so...its on the corner of pucker and pokagon....I Love all the sky!   ya...that''s it...look in my profile  how did you get the water/irragation line out of the photo???  It''s a wonderful tree!!!', '2009-02-04 15:24:21.000000', '2009-02-04 15:24:47.000000', 0),
