(5268587, 759713, 8367, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rando D300:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basssman7:</b></div><hr/><i> This has got to be a frozen tree by Niagara Falls.  Great shot.  Drag about the DQ. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I should have read the rules:)Lets just call it a brain freeze !! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It Happens.  Great shot, none the less.</td>', 'Originally posted by Rando D300: Originally posted by basssman7: This has got to be a frozen tree by Niagara Falls.  Great shot.  Drag about the DQ.   I should have read the rules:)Lets just call it a brain freeze !!   It Happens.  Great shot, none the less.', '2009-02-22 10:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
